<Mod id="5f612783-7a32-435a-a3f5-35e17affeeda" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Moorish Wonders</Name>
    <Stability>Alpha</Stability>
    <Teaser>Adds 2 Moorish wonders:

The Mosque-Cathedral of Cordoba: +1 faith from culture producing buildings in the city.

Medina Az</Teaser>
    <Description>Adds 2 Moorish wonders:

The Mosque-Cathedral of Cordoba: +2 culture from temples empire-wide. 

Medina Azahara: +1 gold for each luxury worked by the city.  Gain 175 Culture each time a Great work or an improvement by a great person is made( does not include missions, such as spread religion and trade missions)

Compatible with More Luxuries by Barathor

Credits
icons by regalmanemperor
Lua by FramedArchitecture
Voice Acting by CharlatanAlley</Description>
    <Authors>regalmanemperor</Authors>
